\begin{itemize}
\item Wikipedia, ``Shamang language''. \url{https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shamang_language}
\item Wikipedia, ``Central Plateau languages'': a classification table placing Shamang in the Hyamic group. \url{https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Central_Plateau_languages}
\item Wikipedia, ``Plateau languages'': background on the wider group. \url{https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Plateau_languages}
\end{itemize}
No grammar, dictionary or orthography was found.

