The Global Recordings Network has a language page for xsh. Its content could not be checked in the search, so whether audio or scripture material exists is unconfirmed. \url{https://globalrecordings.net/en/language/xsh}
No community organisation was found.

\section{Digital and Audio Resources}
See the Global Recordings Network page above. No other digital resources were found.

\section{Curriculum Development Context}
Documentation is thin, and the search found no teaching materials in or about Shamang. Work would begin with fieldwork and community consultation. Nigerian school instruction in the area likely relies on Hausa and English, but no source in the search confirmed this. Do not substitute Sha (scw) materials.
